Treats an empty tile URL list as a source with no tiles, so rendering does not
throw while constructing a tile. Keeps empty sources available for later URL
updates without changing style or TileJSON validation
(https://github.com/maplibre/maplibre-native-ffi/issues/1385).
Upstream: https://github.com/maplibre/maplibre-native/pull/4920

diff --git a/src/mln/renderer/sources/render_tile_source.cpp b/src/mln/renderer/sources/render_tile_source.cpp
